  "description": "Test build of Zed's Contempt for the Weak and Death Mark from real health and damage (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Zed so his attacks on a champion below 50% health add 6/8/10% of its max health as magic damage (10 s per target), and his Death Mark bursts for its base damage plus 35% of the damage he dealt to the marked champion, instead of the data pack's stand-ins (an attack after a spell hit, three hits counted), which cannot read health or damage. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
